LICENSE.

Wain renames Dray and modifies it. The files changed from Dray are every file in
this repository: scripts/rebrand.mjs renames upstream's code to Wain, and the
git history (branch upstream-renamed, trailer "Upstream:") records which
upstream commit each change came from. "Dray" is used here only to describe
where Wain comes from.
